+			/* A firmware/NVM download is still running.  The
+			 * controller is not in IBS mode yet, so there is no
+			 * in-band-sleep handshake to perform.  Skipping it and
+			 * allowing the system to suspend is better than failing
+			 * the whole transition: a Bluetooth firmware update must
+			 * not keep the whole device awake.
